            <strong>Birthday:</strong><br /> July 29, 2005
        </div>
        <div style="background-color:#d8bfd8; padding:15px; border-radius:12px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
            <strong>Address:</strong><br /> Libungan, Cotabato, Philippines
        </div>
        <div style="background-color:#f0fff0; padding:15px; border-radius:12px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
            <strong>Email:</strong><br /> lazagacharlendane@example.com
        </div>
        <div style="background-color:#fff0f5; padding:15px; border-radius:12px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
